OL,3,GNEWSAHousing or data centre? London's
OL,4,Aland-use dilemma
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed 100,000 sq m (1 million sq
OL,7,Fft) data development on industrial land
OL,8,Fat Charlton Riverside has been dubbed
OL,9,F"concerning", with Greenwich Council
OL,10,Fopposing the idea before the centre's
OL,11,Fplanning application has been
OL,12,Fsubmitted.
OL,14,FSupporters say data centres are
OL,15,Fcritical infrastructure that power
OL,16,Ftechnology many people rely on.
